WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Safex

00:00:15.582 --> 00:00:17.277
The spring is coming...

00:00:17.584 --> 00:00:21.608
Candy's leaving for the
Merry Jane Nursing School.

00:00:21.758 --> 00:00:27.057
Kurin and the children of Pony's Home
went to the station to see her off.

00:00:38.839 --> 00:00:44.402
The granny in the street.

00:00:48.548 --> 00:00:50.914
What a city!

00:00:51.351 --> 00:00:54.616
It's four hours from Pony's Home.

00:00:58.758 --> 00:01:01.386
Why drive carelessly?

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:06.419
Fortunately, my reflexes are still good!

00:01:06.569 --> 00:01:09.190
So lucky! My dress is still clean.

00:01:09.340 --> 00:01:11.324
It is not lucky at all!

00:01:11.474 --> 00:01:15.601
Look! It's all your fault.

00:01:15.876 --> 00:01:18.436
It was the driver's fault.

00:01:27.287 --> 00:01:28.618
Granny, look out!

00:01:36.496 --> 00:01:38.361
That was close.

00:01:41.268 --> 00:01:42.929
Are you alright, Granny?

00:01:49.209 --> 00:01:53.873
I'm almost done. It's all your fault.

00:01:54.581 --> 00:01:55.980
What?

00:02:05.292 --> 00:02:06.759
Excuse me!

00:02:11.631 --> 00:02:13.656
This...

00:02:14.034 --> 00:02:16.827
I forgot that! Thanks!

00:02:16.977 --> 00:02:18.666
Granny!

00:02:21.107 --> 00:02:22.404
Wait!

00:02:22.943 --> 00:02:24.604
Excuse me!

00:02:26.212 --> 00:02:27.672
Granny!

00:02:27.822 --> 00:02:29.406
Where are you going?

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:32.742
The Joseph hospital over there.

00:02:32.892 --> 00:02:34.319
Joseph hospital?

00:02:38.224 --> 00:02:42.282
The hospital is around the school.

00:02:42.432 --> 00:02:46.024
Granny, I'll escort you there.

00:02:47.734 --> 00:02:50.100
Mind your own business.

00:02:50.737 --> 00:02:55.640
But... I'm going to the nurse school.

00:02:56.242 --> 00:02:57.539
The nurse school?

00:03:06.753 --> 00:03:08.376
What for?

00:03:08.526 --> 00:03:11.651
What for?
To become a nurse, of course!

00:03:12.959 --> 00:03:17.055
To become a nurse? You talk too much.

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:22.259
What a strange granny!

00:03:22.409 --> 00:03:24.837
But there's no one to help her...

00:03:25.005 --> 00:03:28.668
Yes. Let's go!

00:03:33.713 --> 00:03:38.150
Why did the family let her out alone?

00:03:38.918 --> 00:03:40.886
I have no family.

00:03:41.588 --> 00:03:45.112
I am sorry,
your hearing is excellent.

00:03:45.262 --> 00:03:47.284
My mouth is more excellent.

00:03:48.928 --> 00:03:51.158
I knew that already!

00:03:54.734 --> 00:03:57.259
So, you came from the Pony's Home?

00:03:58.138 --> 00:04:02.074
It's not easy to become a nurse.

00:04:02.609 --> 00:04:04.008
I knew that!

00:04:07.614 --> 00:04:12.415
You know that?
The nurse needs to look after patients.

00:04:13.653 --> 00:04:16.781
There are troublesome patients,
sometimes.

00:04:18.024 --> 00:04:20.322
She's talking about herself.

00:04:26.733 --> 00:04:28.325
We are here!

00:04:30.437 --> 00:04:32.098
Joseph hospital.

00:04:33.773 --> 00:04:37.229
Merry Jane Nursing School.

00:04:37.379 --> 00:04:40.801
They are in the same location.

00:04:41.147 --> 00:04:45.447
Granny, I'll go to the school.
Take care!

00:04:49.956 --> 00:04:52.447
Leave the patients aside.

00:04:52.792 --> 00:04:56.125
What a strange granny!

00:05:00.667 --> 00:05:03.329
I'm here now!

00:05:09.976 --> 00:05:14.538
It feels like the hospital,
it's a nurse school alright!

00:05:16.916 --> 00:05:20.249
A pure white world, fantastic!

00:05:21.488 --> 00:05:23.479
They must be the students.

00:05:26.226 --> 00:05:29.195
White uniform. Feels so good.

00:05:30.096 --> 00:05:32.360
How would I look in that dress?

00:05:34.634 --> 00:05:36.189
Excuse me.

00:05:36.339 --> 00:05:37.394
Yes!

00:05:37.937 --> 00:05:41.231
Patients must not come in here.

00:05:41.381 --> 00:05:43.532
But I am not a patient.

00:05:43.682 --> 00:05:46.132
I have an appointment
with the headmistress.

00:05:46.282 --> 00:05:49.409
The information desk is over there.

00:05:51.050 --> 00:05:53.911
The information desk?
I didn't notice that.

00:05:54.061 --> 00:05:57.387
We might be good friends someday.
How do you do?

00:06:01.928 --> 00:06:05.830
She looked cool, but very efficient.

00:06:06.933 --> 00:06:09.725
Are you Candice White?

00:06:09.875 --> 00:06:13.805
The headmistress said that
she will be here in an hour.

00:06:14.741 --> 00:06:16.066
An hour later?

00:06:16.216 --> 00:06:19.402
Why don't you leave the luggage here...

00:06:19.552 --> 00:06:22.447
Look around the city for an hour.

00:06:23.283 --> 00:06:25.148
It sounds strange.

00:06:27.353 --> 00:06:31.614
After entering the school,
I might have no time to look around.

00:06:31.764 --> 00:06:33.449
It's a good chance.

00:06:33.599 --> 00:06:35.323
Where are you going?

00:06:36.095 --> 00:06:37.858
Granny!

00:06:38.665 --> 00:06:41.259
I'm free for an hour.

00:06:43.303 --> 00:06:46.534
You can stay with me! Come!

00:06:51.110 --> 00:06:54.170
You told me that you live alone.

00:06:54.581 --> 00:06:56.572
I have been alone all the time.

00:06:57.016 --> 00:07:00.641
So does sister Pony
and headmistress at Merry Jane.

00:07:00.791 --> 00:07:03.242
The headmistress is an odd person.

00:07:03.392 --> 00:07:05.084
It is not like that.

00:07:05.291 --> 00:07:07.848
Headmistress Merry Jane
takes care of the patients.

00:07:07.998 --> 00:07:12.255
She is a great woman.

00:07:12.405 --> 00:07:13.764
Maybe...

00:07:15.001 --> 00:07:16.894
So does sister Pony.

00:07:17.044 --> 00:07:20.166
She gave up everything for us.

00:07:21.140 --> 00:07:25.008
So does sister Lane,
they are all great women.

00:07:26.946 --> 00:07:29.312
Not again!

00:07:29.515 --> 00:07:31.037
What's wrong with you?

00:07:31.187 --> 00:07:33.808
You kept away from that last time.

00:07:33.958 --> 00:07:36.582
If I did that, what will you do?

00:07:37.423 --> 00:07:42.417
Don't worry!
My reflection nerve is normal.

00:07:43.963 --> 00:07:47.126
How unreasonable she is.

00:07:47.934 --> 00:07:50.693
Are you mad at me?

00:07:50.843 --> 00:07:53.328
No!

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:56.364
I see. That's good!

00:07:56.514 --> 00:08:00.537
You can not be a good nurse,
if you lose your temper easily.

00:08:09.455 --> 00:08:12.113
Here is the park of the city.

00:08:12.263 --> 00:08:14.819
A good place for a walk.

00:08:16.095 --> 00:08:17.960
I need a rest over there.

00:08:18.564 --> 00:08:20.828
- Keep it for me.
- Yes!

00:08:25.305 --> 00:08:27.830
Clean the bench for me.

00:08:28.074 --> 00:08:29.735
Okay!

00:08:30.610 --> 00:08:33.841
- But...
- With your handkerchief, of course.

00:08:42.221 --> 00:08:44.985
I should not told her that
I want to be a nurse!

00:08:45.491 --> 00:08:46.715
Sit down, please.

00:08:46.865 --> 00:08:50.887
You've done that before I complained,
that's good.

00:08:51.731 --> 00:08:54.256
She complains about everything.

00:08:54.634 --> 00:08:59.594
As a nurse, I have to
deal with all kinds of patients.

00:09:01.607 --> 00:09:03.165
Stand it!

00:09:05.945 --> 00:09:08.072
I'm hungry!

00:09:09.248 --> 00:09:10.806
I'm hungry too.

00:09:12.251 --> 00:09:14.913
Just a moment, I'll buy you some food.

00:09:25.631 --> 00:09:27.991
He'll catch a cold sleeping here.

00:09:28.141 --> 00:09:30.331
You can have it for a while.

00:09:57.563 --> 00:09:59.428
A hamburger for you.

00:10:00.967 --> 00:10:02.140
Here!

00:10:02.290 --> 00:10:04.429
Did you wash your hands?

00:10:05.605 --> 00:10:09.735
It's not sanitary.
Go wash them over there.

00:10:11.377 --> 00:10:12.776
Yes!

00:10:24.123 --> 00:10:25.852
It's cold!

00:10:26.893 --> 00:10:30.556
She complains about everything,
but with good reason.

00:10:40.206 --> 00:10:42.106
Sorry for keeping you waiting!

00:10:42.608 --> 00:10:44.576
It is alright now!

00:10:45.111 --> 00:10:47.978
- Here!
- Thank you!

00:10:49.148 --> 00:10:50.911
Take some milk.

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:55.379
Where is your lunch?

00:10:55.529 --> 00:10:57.716
- It's alright!
- Aren't you hungry?

00:10:58.224 --> 00:11:03.127
No, I can buy only one bottle.

00:11:04.363 --> 00:11:06.831
And, you give it to me...

00:11:07.767 --> 00:11:09.291
Please!

00:11:17.176 --> 00:11:19.570
But, you'll be in trouble...

00:11:19.720 --> 00:11:21.806
In what trouble?

00:11:23.583 --> 00:11:25.141
You see...

00:11:28.154 --> 00:11:30.816
The Merry Jane nursing school...

00:11:34.393 --> 00:11:37.226
They have an entrance exam.

00:11:38.798 --> 00:11:41.028
An exam?

00:11:43.603 --> 00:11:48.563
Without the exam, how would they know
if you're qualified or not?

00:11:49.175 --> 00:11:53.635
It sounds reasonable,
but I never heard of that before.

00:11:54.180 --> 00:11:57.946
It's an extremely difficult exam.

00:11:59.385 --> 00:12:00.852
Extremely difficult?

00:12:02.588 --> 00:12:08.857
That should be done.
It's related to one's live.

00:12:10.229 --> 00:12:13.357
I'm finished; I'm not good at exams.

00:12:16.102 --> 00:12:17.592
What's the matter?

00:12:18.437 --> 00:12:22.299
Nothing, there's no exam for me.

00:12:22.449 --> 00:12:27.311
Sister Pony and the headmistress
are good friends.

00:12:27.613 --> 00:12:31.975
I have a recommendation
from sister Pony.

00:12:32.125 --> 00:12:34.814
That won't help you!

00:12:35.254 --> 00:12:40.780
You have no idea about that school,
it's extremely strict.

00:12:40.930 --> 00:12:44.795
Even the daughter of president
was rejected by them.

00:12:45.164 --> 00:12:47.098
I see!

00:12:48.935 --> 00:12:51.130
What should I do if they refused me?

00:12:51.971 --> 00:12:54.330
I've no money to go back.

00:12:54.480 --> 00:12:56.202
You don't want to eat?

00:12:58.077 --> 00:13:00.807
I will take it.

00:13:02.048 --> 00:13:05.040
The destiny is in your own hands.

00:13:18.497 --> 00:13:22.224
It's an hour already.

00:13:22.374 --> 00:13:23.927
No!

00:13:24.170 --> 00:13:27.867
I should go home now, where is my muffler?

00:13:29.308 --> 00:13:33.142
The muffler... the man over there...

00:13:33.779 --> 00:13:34.868
He is gone!

00:13:35.018 --> 00:13:38.144
What happened to my muffler?

00:13:38.985 --> 00:13:42.682
There was a man sleeping on the bench...

00:13:43.022 --> 00:13:46.150
Dim-wit! What's up to you?

00:13:46.325 --> 00:13:49.783
I am sorry!
I will have it back for sure.

00:13:49.996 --> 00:13:51.923
Where you live?

00:13:52.073 --> 00:13:55.489
Take it to the hospital,
I'll get it later.

00:13:55.701 --> 00:13:57.293
As you wish!

00:14:03.342 --> 00:14:05.401
Where is that man?

00:14:29.168 --> 00:14:31.136
I can find him nowhere.

00:14:31.537 --> 00:14:33.835
I will have to get her a new muffler.

00:14:34.774 --> 00:14:38.733
No! The interview with the headmistress!

00:14:41.647 --> 00:14:44.741
I forgot everything
while looking for the muffler.

00:14:49.055 --> 00:14:51.780
What's the matter with you?

00:14:51.930 --> 00:14:53.081
I am sorry!

00:14:53.231 --> 00:14:56.182
The headmistress has been waiting
for an hour.

00:14:56.332 --> 00:14:57.956
An hour?

00:14:58.698 --> 00:15:02.225
She must be mad! What should I do?

00:15:07.206 --> 00:15:09.037
This way, please.

00:15:12.278 --> 00:15:13.939
At last!

00:15:18.117 --> 00:15:21.709
My foot is killing me!

00:15:21.859 --> 00:15:25.484
Bestir yourself,
Candy. don't be useless.

00:15:30.029 --> 00:15:31.758
It's okay!

00:15:46.312 --> 00:15:48.007
Here we are!

00:15:49.115 --> 00:15:51.015
Thank you.

00:16:00.426 --> 00:16:03.486
The last course, go!

00:16:08.934 --> 00:16:10.492
Come in.

00:16:18.677 --> 00:16:24.115
Uh... I'm sorry for being late.

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:30.052
I'm Candice White,
recommended by sister Pony.

00:16:36.495 --> 00:16:39.157
Granny!

00:16:42.601 --> 00:16:47.025
I am the headmaster here!

00:16:47.175 --> 00:16:49.437
The headmaster?

00:16:49.809 --> 00:16:50.898
I am dying...

00:16:51.048 --> 00:16:52.978
Dim-wit!

00:16:56.682 --> 00:16:59.276
Was Pony your teacher?

00:16:59.718 --> 00:17:01.083
I am sorry!

00:17:02.288 --> 00:17:05.451
- Candice White.
- Yes!

00:17:06.625 --> 00:17:11.585
I give you the permission
to enter the Merry Jane nursing school.

00:17:13.732 --> 00:17:16.292
How about the examination?

00:17:17.036 --> 00:17:19.593
You have already passed.

00:17:19.743 --> 00:17:22.262
You mistook me as a patient.

00:17:22.412 --> 00:17:27.607
It was a good chance for testing you
if you are a good nurse or not.

00:17:28.047 --> 00:17:29.981
That means...

00:17:31.750 --> 00:17:35.145
Kindness is the most important thing
that the nurse must have.

00:17:35.295 --> 00:17:38.098
Never discriminate against the old man.

00:17:38.248 --> 00:17:41.921
But, your mind is not clear enough.

00:17:42.828 --> 00:17:48.253
The nurse must judge accurately.

00:17:48.403 --> 00:17:49.726
Yes!

00:17:49.876 --> 00:17:52.633
Make things clear!

00:17:55.975 --> 00:17:57.429
It's Franny!

00:17:57.579 --> 00:17:59.599
The history of the patient
of the special ward.

00:17:59.749 --> 00:18:01.805
- Come in!
- Excuse me.

00:18:05.384 --> 00:18:06.851
It's you...

00:18:10.789 --> 00:18:12.222
Do you know her?

00:18:13.659 --> 00:18:15.535
- No!
- It's...

00:18:15.685 --> 00:18:17.521
We met earlier.

00:18:17.671 --> 00:18:19.029
That's good.

00:18:19.298 --> 00:18:24.565
Franny, a new schoolmate.
Candice White.

00:18:25.170 --> 00:18:27.661
Show her the campus.

00:18:29.875 --> 00:18:33.799
Candice, Franny is an elder,
Learn from her.

00:18:33.949 --> 00:18:35.380
Yes!

00:18:38.684 --> 00:18:40.172
That's horrible!

00:18:40.322 --> 00:18:42.342
Is she always so fierce?

00:18:42.492 --> 00:18:43.509
That's right!

00:18:43.659 --> 00:18:47.285
Her name sounds so lovely,
in fact...

00:18:47.493 --> 00:18:49.688
The granny...

00:18:55.301 --> 00:18:59.859
Uh...
I was recommended by sister Pony.

00:19:00.009 --> 00:19:04.874
She is round and chubby,
the headmistress looks so skinny.

00:19:07.446 --> 00:19:09.073
Here is the classroom.

00:19:13.152 --> 00:19:16.485
It's different from St. Paul academy.

00:19:23.362 --> 00:19:25.227
The laboratory.

00:19:29.435 --> 00:19:31.300
The library.

00:19:36.475 --> 00:19:37.999
So excellent!

00:19:49.355 --> 00:19:51.550
This is our room.

00:19:52.691 --> 00:19:55.319
We are roommates! Nice to meet you!

00:20:00.299 --> 00:20:03.234
Here is your desk and bed.

00:20:04.703 --> 00:20:06.261
Yes!

00:20:07.806 --> 00:20:10.969
The uniform is in the closet
next to desk.

00:20:13.779 --> 00:20:15.970
This school
is different from other school.

00:20:16.120 --> 00:20:19.141
We practice and study in the hospital.

00:20:19.518 --> 00:20:22.885
There are lots of patients around,
do everything carefully.

00:20:25.991 --> 00:20:28.186
- Excuse me...
- What's the matter?

00:20:28.927 --> 00:20:30.252
- Nothing!
- Don't bother me...

00:20:30.402 --> 00:20:31.852
for nothing.

00:20:33.132 --> 00:20:35.559
As a roommate, I have a request...

00:20:35.709 --> 00:20:39.967
I hate the one who talk too much.
Over!

00:20:46.812 --> 00:20:48.739
So efficient.

00:20:48.889 --> 00:20:52.908
She's not a bad person anyway!

00:20:53.152 --> 00:20:55.484
Mind my own business.

00:20:57.756 --> 00:20:59.383
It's beautiful.

00:21:00.159 --> 00:21:05.495
It's Candy's first step
in becoming a nurse.

00:21:09.268 --> 00:21:10.792
I must do my best!

00:21:11.036 --> 00:21:15.200
Candy encouraged herself in her heart.
